### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Engenheiro Teste",
  "email": "engenheiro@teste.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "engenheiro@teste.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

# Copie o token retornado acima para as requisições abaixo.
@token = COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### Me
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List visits
GET http://localhost:3000/api/visits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create visit
POST http://localhost:3000/api/visits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "factoryName": "Fábrica Exemplo",
  "factoryAddress": "Av. Industrial, 1200",
  "factoryContact": "Responsável técnico"
}
